      "releaseNotes": "This new version includes:\n- Improved video playback experience on iPad.\n- Optimized floating player layout and behavior across screen sizes.\n- Fixed layout issues that could appear after rotating the device multiple times.\n- Improved browser toolbar layout stability.\n- Simplified extension options page.\n- General stability and performance improvements.",
